      "signature": "ll_rtc_alarm_a_set(uint8_t hours, uint8_t minutes, uint8_t seconds)",
      "returns": "void",
      "brief": "Set Alarm A to trigger at a specific time (24h format). Set hours/minutes/seconds to the desired alarm time. Fields with 0xFF are masked (ignored for matching). Example: alarm at 08:30:00 every day: ll_rtc_alarm_a_set(8, 30, 0); Example: alarm every hour at XX:30:00: ll_rtc_alarm_a_set(0xFF, 30, 0);",
      "params": [
